      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm really sorry to hear that you're feeling this way. It's completely okay to feel overwhelmed and scared. Remember, however, that you are more than these moments. Take time to care for yourself and reach out to friends, family, or a therapist for support. Your mind is powerful, and it's always possible for it to bounce back stronger. None of this defines you, and there are people who love and value you just as much as you are right now.",
